<title>GERMANY: Czech c.bank gov says price stability top priority.</title>
<headline>Czech c.bank gov says price stability top priority.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech central bank (CNB) governor Josef Tosovsky said on Thursday that, although the exchange of the crown was important, price stability was a higher priority at the moment.</p>
<p>&quot;We certainly consider the stability of the exchange rate as very important, but at the moment price stability is more important,&quot; Tosovsky told a meeting of the German-Czech society in Frankfurt.</p>
</text>
